trong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unruly Creator&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dynamite Generator&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Block Generator&quot;, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(To be developed depending on future sales)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Glass Stage&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Cover Stage&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional items, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the images used in this game are used with permission from JoyJoyMAX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The copyright for these images belongs to JoyJoyMAX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows gameplay videos (streaming, recording, and uploading) as long as the following conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permitted Platforms and Uses</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming/uploading on major platforms such as YouTube, Twitch, Nico Nico Douga, and X (formerly Twitter) is allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commercial use and monetization (ad revenue, super chats, etc.) are also permitted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may use game footage in thumbnails and during your videos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please Observe the Following Rules</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not modify or present the game in a misleading way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not infringe upon the rights of others (e.g., unauthorized use of music or assets).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For major story spoilers, please include a warning in the video title or description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not use the game for harassment, defamation, or intentionally controversial content.</p></li></ul>",
